WEBVTT

00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:14,140
Is there a specific tumor marker for a suffered geolcancer?

00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:17,140
If yes, what would be the range of numbers?

00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:21,140
We spoke to our internist about laser surgery for the esophagus.

00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:24,140
He said, it would not get rid of the cancer,

00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:27,140
but would improve the esophagus for eating solids.

00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:30,140
We did not know of any laser surgeons for that part of the body.

00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:33,140
Do you know of any specific laser surgeons?

00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:36,140
So I don't know of any specific laser surgeons.

00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:44,140
We might have to continue to seek some advice from medical professions for that.

00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:49,140
There is no specific tumor marker for a suffered geolcancer.

00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:55,140
You could run a tumor marker panel and any of them might show up,

00:00:55,140 --> 00:00:59,140
but there's none that are specific for that cancer.

